	- read_registry, read_database and read_dataset now stop with an error naming each requested id that is not found; previously read_registry returned list() and read_database/read_dataset returned an empty result

2026-11-04  Byron Botha  <byron@codera.co.za>

	- added citation column to data providers in read_registry/write_registry, stored as a "citation" annotation on each data provider
	- fixed write_registry for agency schemes, which sent agencies under the wrong key
	- fixed read_registry/write_registry for memberlists failing on member annotations
	- memberlists now support agency memberships (membership_type "agency")
	- memberlists now round-trip members without memberships and optional email/firstname/lastname
	- write_registry method = "delete" now supported for all registry structures
	- write_database method = "delete" deletes data sets, or individual series via series_key
	- JSON is now written at full precision (digits = NA); previously values were rounded to 4 decimal places

